# Post-edit lint and format

After completing any substantive code change (new file, edited file, refactor):

1. Run `npm run lint -- --fix` to auto-fix ESLint issues and report any that need manual attention.
2. If the project has a formatter configured (Prettier, etc.), run it too.
3. Re-read the edited files with the lint tool (`ReadLints`) to confirm no remaining errors.
4. If lint errors remain after auto-fix, fix them before marking the task complete.

Do not skip this step even for small changes — lint errors compound quickly.
